{"packId":"daily-2026-12-01","packVersion":2,"scoringVersion":1,"date":"2026-12-01","number":76,"puzzles":[{"id":"2026-12-01-pattern","skill":"pattern","kind":"grid","prompt":"Which shape completes the grid?","cells":[{"shape":"circle","tone":"blue"},{"shape":"square","tone":"teal"},{"shape":"triangle","tone":"navy"},{"shape":"square","tone":"teal"},{"shape":"triangle","tone":"navy"},{"shape":"circle","tone":"blue"},{"shape":"triangle","tone":"navy"},null,{"shape":"square","tone":"teal"}],"options":[{"shape":"triangle","tone":"navy"},{"shape":"diamond","tone":"gold"},{"shape":"square","tone":"teal"},{"shape":"circle","tone":"blue"}],"answer":3,"explanation":["Every row and every column uses each shape exactly once.","Its row already has the navy triangle and the teal square.","Its column already has the teal square and the navy triangle.","That leaves the blue circle."]},{"id":"2026-12-01-sudoku","skill":"sudoku","prompt":"Fill the grid with 1 to 6","size":6,"boxR":2,"boxC":3,"givens":[3,0,2,0,0,0,1,0,5,0,6,3,0,0,3,1,0,0,0,0,0,5,0,6,4,0,1,6,0,0,0,2,6,0,1,0],"solution":[3,6,2,4,5,1,1,4,5,2,6,3,6,5,3,1,4,2,2,1,4,5,3,6,4,3,1,6,2,5,5,2,6,3,1,4],"explanation":["Every row, every column and every 2×3 box uses each number from 1 to 6 exactly once.","The finished grid:","Row 1: 3 6 2 4 5 1","Row 2: 1 4 5 2 6 3","Row 3: 6 5 3 1 4 2","Row 4: 2 1 4 5 3 6","Row 5: 4 3 1 6 2 5","Row 6: 5 2 6 3 1 4"]},{"id":"2026-12-01-logic","skill":"logic","prompt":"Crack the 3-digit code","clues":[{"guess":[7,1,6],"rightPlace":0,"wrongPlace":2},{"guess":[3,5,9],"rightPlace":1,"wrongPlace":0},{"guess":[3,8,7],"rightPlace":0,"wrongPlace":0},{"guess":[1,4,2],"rightPlace":0,"wrongPlace":1}],"answer":[6,5,1],"explanation":["716: 1, 6 are in the code but placed differently.","359: 5 is in the right spot.","387: none of 3, 8, 7 appear in the code.","142: 1 is in the code but placed differently."],"hint":"The last digit is odd."}]}